427
00:19:26,660 --> 00:19:29,640
可是我跟她很熟  而她是个很棒的人
But I do know her, and she's an amazing person.

428
00:19:30,180 --> 00:19:31,640
他爸爸独自抚养她成人
And her father raised her alone,

429
